        "observed_at": "2026-09-24T13:34:04Z",
        "source": "https://www.reddit.com/r/HearingAids/synthetic_s2b_check",
        "text": "Honestly I'm about ready to give up on these. Paid a fortune, and the left one dies by 4pm every single day. The audiologist says it's normal. Is it? I'm comparing the new models but I don't want to spend again if it's just going to be the same story.",
        "text_sha256": "sha256:297291a67762932b70f7eb36c788e2fdae408bc21ff0e5ff14a61ea7baff5758"
      },
      "draft": {
        "text": "Six weeks on the Phonak Audeo Sphere Infinio now, so here are the numbers you asked for. Battery: 13-14 hours with about three hours of streaming, not the 16 on the spec sheet. Charger takes 2h50m from empty. The Spheric speech mode is the real difference - I tested it in the same cafe on three evenings, with it on I followed the table, with it off I missed every other sentence. One correction to what I posted before: the wax guards are the CeruShield discs, not the old SmartGuards, and they need changing every four weeks not eight.",
        "text_sha256": "sha256:1c1241afe939ce6074ff98098cacc9b9ebe5eaa718849adc8e1adbf2961d75ce"
      }
    }
